A note on what hosting does and does not mean for licensing. This program loads
LV2 and VST3 plug-ins that the user chose and that this project neither ships nor
links. Some of them will be GPL-licensed; that is the user's own act of running
two programs together, and it places no obligation on this source tree. What
matters on this side is the rule this project actually enforces: no GPLv3 code and
no JUCE header may enter this include graph, and every dependency named below is
MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, MPL-2.0, ISC, zlib or OFL.

